logs.txt

# Phase 40: untracked personal nutrition reference photography. Kept
# off-repo because the folder is ~MB of user-owned shots with no
# production asset binding in pubspec.yaml.
Beslenme-Photos/

# Tier 3 · standalone Vite + Tailwind ASO landing-page project that
# lives alongside the Flutter app for convenience. Not a Flutter
# dependency, not declared in pubspec, never bundled. 245 MB of
# node_modules + Vite exports that asosystem/.gitignore already
# excludes internally — but the asosystem/ root itself wasn't
# gitignored, so a `git add .` from someone unaware would stage 700+
# unrelated files. Pin it shut here. To work on it, just `cd
# asosystem/ && npm run dev`; git operations from the Flutter root
# stay clean.
asosystem/

# Phase 0 (P-Risk) · Play upload certificate (public cert; untracked for hygiene)
upload-cert.pem

# Phase 2 (P-Risk) · gen-l10n output — regenerated by `flutter pub get`
# (generate: true). The .arb sources + l10n.yaml are tracked; generated Dart is not.
/lib/l10n/app_localizations*.dart

# Roadmap Phase 9 · the founder's own planning material, and why this
# block exists.
#
# These files had been deliberately untracked through eight phases —
# strategic roadmaps, audits, unreleased store artwork and two Play
# Console PDFs. A `git add -A` staged all fifteen of them into a PUBLIC
# repository, and the secret scan is what caught it (one of the roadmaps
# discusses a dummy `test_secret_key`, which gitleaks reads as a leak).
#
# "Untracked" is not a safeguard; it is the absence of one. Anything that
# must stay out of this repository belongs here, where a wildcard `add`
# cannot reach it.
FORMAI_DEEP_TECHNICAL_AUDIT.md
FORMAI_P_RISK_ELIMINATION_ROADMAP.md
FORMAI_STRATEGIC_DIRECTION_REPORT.md
FORMAI_VIDEO_ANALYSIS_MASTER_ROADMAP.md
PRODUCT_DEEP_AUDIT.md
TESTERS_COMMUNITY_PRODUCT_ROADMAP.md
formai_mission.txt
com.emredogan.formaifit_*.pdf
playstore-new-ASO/

# Python bytecode from tool/*.py (Play asset pipeline).
__pycache__/
*.pyc
